"""A spelling-based approximation to the component's positive suffix response.

Track a word fragment and score short noun/adjective endings, adjusting their
strength beside familiar Greek-derived stems. Romanization shares these rules
across scripts. Also model 'of' after discipline names, middle-dot leaders,
document-opening triple quotes, and a small first-token baseline. This misses
many word-specific and negative responses.
